        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are Robert Knox, the head of Kronstadt Industries, three F-1 racers and a U.S. Army Colonel assigned to Special Operations Command. They form a group that is using its global access and fame to trade in a range of highly controlled illegal narcotics, biological and chemical weapons, and support for money laundering activities. Organized crime and terrorist group facilitators are gaining massive revenues and capability gains via this network. Eliminate them with expedient efficiency.",
